SCP-5942 must be destroyed if possible. At this time, no means available to SCP teams are capable of destroying SCP-5942 only able to cause little to no physical damage. SCP-5942 should be contained within a 130m reinforced acid resistant lead-lined steel plate lining all inside surfaces and is to be observed through reinforced glass or security cameras as to ensure that SCP-5942 is present. The containment chamber should be filled with fluoroantimonic acid, hydrochloric acid, and sulfuric acid until SCP-5942 is submerged and incapacitated the remaining air should be filled with VX gas. Any attempts of SCP-5942 to move, speak, or breach containment should be reacted to quickly and with full force as called for by the circumstances. in the instance of containment breach personnel must wear gas mask to prevent inhaling VX gas.

Personnel are forbidden to speak to SCP-5942, for fear of provoking a rage-state. All unauthorized personnel attempting to communicate to SCP-5942 will be restrained and removed by force unless approved of by O5-██ or Dr. █████████, interviews with SCP-5942 is temporarily prohibited. Testing of SCP-5942 is to be done in its old containment chamber.

Due to its frequent attempts at containment breach, difficulty of containment and incapacitation, and high threat of Foundation Exposure, SCP-5942 is to be contained in [REDACTED]. The Foundation will use the best of its resources to maintain all land within fifty (150) kilometers clear of human development, anyone trying to settle within this area must be administered Class C anmistics or terminated if necessary. If SCP-5942 is to be transported to another site or area for any reason, it must be be heavily sedated and tranquilized to prevent containment breach.




