Always grant its request (if any), unless it includes destruction of a city or harming of humans2.


Although SCP-5942's behavior is unpredictable and can be aggressive or docile, procedure 180 Halo must be followed at all cost, failure to do any of the rules in Procedure 180 Halo, Procedure 018, to prevent multiple K-Class Scenarios, Procedure 018 must take place:

