Description:  SCP-5942 is a large, vaguely reptile-like creature of unknown origin approximately 80 meters in height and 125 meter in length and has an estimated weight of around 150,000 to 200,000 tons. It has about 258 dorsal plates from head to tail. The entity appears to be extremely intelligent.SCP-5942 has always been observed to have extremely high strength, speed, and reflexes, though exact levels vary with its form. It can run at a top speed of 150]km/h, it's top speed when swimming is 300km/h.

It has been observed to be able shoot a laser-like high velocity projectile mouth and back in the form of a blue or red radioactive beam or a pulseEntire Universe . SCP-5942's respiratory system produces and breathes out large amounts of a Class F amnestic (R-76). (see Addendum 5942-L)

SCP-5942's physical body can grow and change very quickly, it depends on the level of radiation in its body and SCP-5942's liking to change its form. SCP-5942 gains energy from the radiation it absorbs, it does not seem to have a digestive tract and seems to be able to turn radiation around it into its energy. aided by a set of filtering gills on its neck and inside its nostrils, which are able to remove usable matter from any liquid solution, enabling it to constantly regenerate from the acid it is contained in.SCP-5942 appears to have a hatred of all Humans, which has been expressed in several interviews during containment and can cause a ZK-Class Reality Failure Scenario.

SCP-5942 displays polymorphic properties, it has 5 forms of itself that are known by the Foundation, but there maybe more as not much is known about the entity. In its 2nd form SCP-5942 is has a more wolf  like appearance, jagged dorsal plates, 60 meters tall, 125 meters long, slimmer and is weaker but more agile.In its 3rd form SCP-5942 is has a more Dinosaur  like appearance, pointy ears, small fangs, a secondary row of teeth, dorsal plates, 100 meters tall, 175 meters long, bulkier, more muscular and is stronger, more agile. If the levels of radiation in its body becomes to high SCP-5942 Enters its 4th form 7 SCP-5942's 5th form is approximately 5 Km in height and about 11 Km in length, it is slower but very powerful, its scale texture is that of tree bark, its teeth are 100 meters big, it has a force field surrounding it, and it can create a very destructive ray of radiation by swiping its tail. In this form SCP-5942 can control its size

In case of containment breach, SCP-5942 is to be tracked and re-captured by all available Mobile Task Forces, and no teams with fewer than fifty (50) members are cleared to engage it. To date (██-██-████), attempted breaches have numbered at seven thousand nine hundred eighty-six (7,986), while successful breaches have numbered at seven thousand eight hundred forty-one (7,841). During a containment breach, SCP-5942 successfully breached containment and some of its tissue were recovered, the sample was examined and test has shown it's non-organic and is made of unknown material and weighs 5 tons. Research on SCP-5942 has resulted in the creation of  8=75 meter tall piloted robots witch are still in testing, by request of the O5 council. Jägers are to be deployed to help contain SCP-5942. (see Document-5942-4)

SCP-5942 was asked on (██-██-████) to prove that it was the creator of the Universe, it made a 5 meter by 5 meter sphere that looks like the earth and said  and puts it in its pocket dimension, after 2 minutes, the news broadcasted that a new galaxy was discovered and the description given was that of the galaxy that SCP-5942 created but was twice the size of the Andromeda Galaxy.

