Document-5942-1:  R-76

SCP-5942 exhale large amounts of an aerosolized Class F amnestic, designated R-76, R-76 causes sedation, long-term paralysis11 and catatonic symptoms. It is colorless, odorless, and tasteless with an estimated R-76 for inhalation of 0.000005942ng•min. In well-ventilated or open air environments, risk of exposure to R-76 is slightly reduced about 0.005%. R-76 is typically undetectable in the bloodstream five (5) seconds following cessation of exposure. Reported sensations of disorientation, seizures, and severe Visual, Tactile and Auditory Hallucinations immediately following removal from environments saturated with the agent are similar to recreational use of numerous psychoactive substances and easily mistaken as such. Some individuals have some level resistance to the effects of R-76

